  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Waterzooi is Ghent's famous stew. Chicken thighs cook gently in stock with root vegetables cut into "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "julienne",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "julienne"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " strips, and the broth is finished with a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "liaison",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "liaison"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " of cream and egg yolk that makes it rich without being heavy."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Take the pan off the heat completely before stirring in the cream and egg mixture. If the liquid is boiling it will curdle."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
